graph TD
    subgraph Client [Client Layer]
        CP[Customer Portal - React SPA]
        AP[CMS Admin Portal - React SPA]
    end

    subgraph API [API Gateway / Security]
        HTTPS[HTTP / REST API]
        JWT[Spring Security JWT Authentication]
    end

    subgraph Server [Backend Service Layer]
        C[Controller Layer - 12 Controllers]
        S[Service Layer - Business Logic]
        R[Repository Layer - Spring Data JPA]
    end

    subgraph Database [Data Layer]
        MySQL[(MySQL 8.x DB)]
    end

    CP -->|REST API + JWT| HTTPS
    AP -->|REST API + JWT| HTTPS
    HTTPS --> JWT
    JWT --> C
    C --> S
    S --> R
    R --> MySQL
